{"2380310": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Living Cell", "steam_appid": 2380310, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2380310/extras/ef0dcd45bf41e034243005a2e364a55b.poster.avif?t=1773961273\" width=736 height=60 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2380310/extras/ef0dcd45bf41e034243005a2e364a55b.webm?t=1773961273\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2380310/extras/ef0dcd45bf41e034243005a2e364a55b.mp4?t=1773961273\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2380310/extras/df06f9161e072b1bb7ea394373d82f0f.avif?t=1773961273\" width=600 height=393 /></span><br><br><strong>Living Cell</strong> is a dark adventure game with elements of survival in a <strong>Samosbor setting</strong>.<br>Explore the living block room by room, avoid poisonous slimes and make sure that the filters of the gas mask do not die ahead of time, and the flashlight continues to work.<br>Learn about the frightening stories of the inhabitants of Gigakhrushchyovka by exploring their everyday life and surroundings.<br><br><i>Survive or become another consumable whose body will go to food concentrate after death.</i><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2380310/extras/f090250399b7ea80f6e7cbd5eafab238.avif?t=1773961273\" width=600 height=240 /></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2380310/extras/60bad0e316f8044d140dc70511dec649.avif?t=1773961273\" wi